WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.778
Being a theory paper, the experiments use
controlled synthetic settings.

00:00:04.858 --> 00:00:12.199
The authors test two finite-rank kernels: a
truncated neural tangent kernel and a constructed low-rank kernel.

00:00:12.279 --> 00:00:17.529
For each they sweep sample sizes from ten to two
hundred and many ridge values,

00:00:17.609 --> 00:00:20.970
averaging ten trials with median and quartile bars.
